+normal production: ACCEPTED; agents 0->0; 13 ms
+scratch candidate `gpgconf --homedir <home> --kill all`: ACCEPTED; agents 0->0; 21 ms
+scratch candidate `--no-autostart`: ACCEPTED; agents 0->0; 9 ms
